.DS_Store

# Runtime artefacts, regenerated on every run.
# NOTE: gitignore has no trailing comments — a pattern is the whole line.
# engine -> oracle feed, truncated per run
events.jsonl
# last measured tx latency, rewritten every bar
oracle_status.json

# Deliberately COMMITTED, do not add here:
#   abi.json         written by deploy.py; frontend and oracle both read it
#   hmm_params.json  the fitted model behind the on-chain immutables — provenance
#   data/crash.csv   historical dataset used by --replay
#   CLAUDE.md        project brief; the repo is public by hackathon rules
#   HANDOFF.md       running log of decisions
